{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version includes 4 creatures that you are able to capture and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creatures are capped at a maximum of level 25.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will feature creatures that can exceed level 100.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this version you may only visit one planet with a maximum of a two creature team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version you will be able to upgrade your ship to hold more creatures, visit additional planets, and control more creatures at one time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expeditions, and Space Mart are available in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Achievements and some Easter eggs have been removed from the demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736870?t=1747408374","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3736870?t=1747408374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736870/976790d3959c5f25eaa70247f35d076c14a59ada/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747408374","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3736870/976790d3959c5f25eaa70247f35d076c14a59ada/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747408374","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo version includes 4 creatures that you are able to capture and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Creatures are capped at a maximum of level 25.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full game will feature creatures that can exceed level 100.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this version you may only visit one planet with a maximum of a two creature team.</p><p class=\"bb_parag